;0m","reader":"readpost$jiuer$mariner$youran$oopp$rob$hongyan$final$gateopen$kstar$jhy$","title":"pk ?[37;0m","time":1029255916,]),(["read_cnt":33,"author":"神聊(chat)","attrib":"RR","msg":"INTERVIEW WITH GODI dreamed I had an INTERVIEW WITH GOD.\"So you would like to interview me?\" GOD asked.\"If you have the time,\" I said.GOD smiled.My time is eternity,what questions do you have in mind for me?\"what surprises you most about humankind?\"GOD answered...That they get bored with childhood,they rush to grow up, and then long to be children again.That they lose their health to make money,and then lose their money to restore health.That by thinking anxiously about the future,they forget the present,such that they live in neither the present nor the future.That they live as if they will never die,and die as though they had never lived.GOD's hand took mine and we were silent for awhile.And then I asked,As a parent,what are some of life's lessons you want your children to learn?To learn they cannot make anyone love them.All they can do is let themselves be loved.To learn that it is not good to compare themselves to others.To learn to forgive by practicing forgiveness.To learn that it only takes a few seconds to open profound wounds in those they love,and it can take many years to heal them.To learn that a rich person is not one who has the most,but is one who needs the least.To learn that there are people who love them dearly,but simply do not yet know how to express or show their feelings.To learn that two people can look at the same thing and see it diffenently.To learn that it is not enough that they forgive one another,but they must also forgive themselves.\"Thank you for your time,\"I said humbly.Is there anything else you'd like your children to know?GOD smiled and said...Just know that I am here.\"Always.\" [37;0m","reader":"gysun$readpost$final$hongyan$gateopen$kstar$jhy$","title":"Interview with God[37;0m","time":1031063823,]),(["read_cnt":28,"author":"油条(youtiao)","attrib":"RR","msg":"与神面谈我梦见我与神面谈\"就是你想跟我面谈?\" 神说。\"如果你有时间的话\"我说。神微微笑了笑。我的时间是无限的,你脑里有什么问题想问我的呢？关于人类，有什么最令你惊讶的呢？神答覆...他们总是觉得童年很闷,整天想快些长大,但真正长大之后,总是梦想再度童年他们总是(废寝忘食,拼命工作)用健康换取金钱,(在有了钱)之后又用金钱来回复(所失的)健康他们总是为将来(会怎样)而烦恼，而忘却现在(之重要),因此,他们无论在现在或将在,都不算真正活过.他们总是(醉生梦死)放纵的生活尤如他们永远不会死,但当死亡真正来临时总是认为他们从没真正好好活过.(聊到这里)神与我牵手,我们(相对无言)沉默了一阵子.(互相忘着,静静地出神。)跟着我问,作为父亲,你想给你的孩子学习那些生命的课题(真啼)？(神说)他们应该学习不能强逼任何人(喜欢)爱他们,他们唯一能做的只是(放宽自己)认别人(喜欢)爱。不能总是拿自己跟别人比(因此每个人都是独一无二的所在)要用(保持)宽恕(的心态)来学习原谅(别人)要知道(清楚),只需几秒就能伤害你所爱的人,而那伤口通常要用好几年来回复要知道(清楚)有钱的人不一定拥有最多(满足),而是那些保持最低要求的人(知足?)要知道(清楚)有人是深深的爱你,但就总是不会表达出来要知道(清楚)两个人就算同时看到同一样东西,但是会有不同的感受要知道(清楚)只能宽恕别人还是不够的,更重要的是原谅自己\"多谢你(宝贵)的时间\"我谦虚谨慎的说.不知道你是否还有什么东西是想你的孩子所知道的呢？神微微笑了笑。说道...只有知道我一直在这里(存在)一直(永远)                           -=WD=-Youtiao[37;0m","reader":"readpost$final$hongyan$gateopen$kstar$","title":"Re 11 尝试翻译[37;0m","time":1031069204,]),(["read_cnt":29,"author":"神聊(chat)","attrib":"RR","msg":"Windows 系列序列号大集合WIN95一定没人用了，我就不放上来了。 Microsoft WindowsXP 2520 Pro 英文版－－60天免激活序列号：RK7J8-2PGYQ-P47VV-V6PMB-F6XPQMicrosoft Windows XP 2505 RC1－－序列号：DTWB2-VX8WY-FG8R3-X696T-66Y46 Q3R8Y-MP9KD-3M6KB-383YB-7PK9Q 411Y0-URB45-34R3B-310N6-70U51 F0R6R-347JU-57IC3-M0V34-11Z16 50M38-0DY53-7UPU5-7H380-M8111Microsoft Windows whistler Beta2 build 2428－－CD Key: RBDC9-VTRC8-D7972-J97JY-PRVMGMicrosoft Whistler Person build 2410－－ SN：F6PGG-4YYDJ-3FF3T-R328P-3BXTGMicrosoft Windows Mellinium(Windows Me)简体中文最终正式版－－s/n: B6BYC-6T7C3-4PXRW-2XKWB-GYV33Microsoft Windows2000 Professional 中文版－－SN：PQHKR-G4JFW-VTY3P-G4WQ2-88CTWMicrosoft Windows 2000 Server－－CD-KEY:H6TWQ-TQQM8-HXJYG-D69F7-R84VMMicrosoft Windows98序列号－－K4HVD-Q9TJ9-6CRX9-C9G68-RQ2D3Microsoft WindowsNT Server4.0－－CDKEY:727-1111111Microsoft WindowsNT workstation－－输入任意合适数目的数码后,最后一 位从0到9试一遍,最多试十次即可。Microsoft Office 2000 简体中文企业版－－序列号： J2MV9-JYYQ6-JM44K-QMYTH-8RB2WMicrosoft（微软）通用序列号－－微软OEM通用序列号 425-1234567微软OEM通用序列号 03697-0020401-XXXXX(X为任意数)微软服务器通用序列号 020-